            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.20+1SA.22.21+1SA.22.22+1SA.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 22:20-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo wacu ni Abiathar ma jalam kumae, Cidh i Anathoth, ba podho peri ma dhe; kum iromo ku tho; ento abinegi i nindo maeni ngo, kum iyeyo sanduk pa Rwoth Yehova i wang’ Daudi ma vwa, man kum jusendi ku gin ceke ma jusendo ko vwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.27+1SA.2.28+1SA.2.29+1SA.2.30+1SA.2.31+1SA.2.32+1SA.2.33+1SA.2.34+1SA.2.35+1SA.2.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 2:27-36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Suleman uriemo Abiathar kud ebed jalam ni Yehova, kara eketh lembe pa Yehova timbre kakare, m’eyero pi ot pa Eli i Cilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E rwonglembene bino ba Yoab; kum Yoab ulokre tok Adonija, kadok elokre tok Absalom ungo. Man Yoab uringo ba Hema pa Yehova, man emaku tung pemblam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man juyero ni ubimo ma Suleman kumae, Yoab uringo ba Hema pa Yehova, man, nen, eni i ng’et pemblam. Suleman ulund uoro Benaya ma wod Yehoiada, ewacu kumae, Cidh, ipodh i wie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Benaya bino ba Hema pa Yehova, man ewacu ire kumae, Ubimo wacu kumae, Ai ku keno. Man ewacu kumae, Ungo; ento abitho keni. Man Benaya dwoko lembe kendo bang’ ubimo, ewacu kuman, Yoab uwacu kuman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo wacu ire kumae, Tim calu ewacu, man ipodh i wie, e iyike; kara ikab rimo woko, ma Yoab ewiro m’umbe lembe, kud i bang’a man ku ba ot pa vwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova bidwoko rimo pare i wie gire, kum epodho wi dhanu ario ma pwe man ma ber ma sagu en, man enegogi ku palamularu, man Daudi ma vwa ng’eyo ngo, en e Abner ma wod Ner, ma jego mir udul mir Israel, kud Amasa ma wod Yether, ma jego mir udul pa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno rimbgi bidwogo i wi Yoab, man wi kodhine mi nja: ento kum Daudi, man kum kodhine, man kum ot pare, man kum komker pare, kwiocwiny m’uai ba Yehova bibedo nuti mi nja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya ma wod Yehoiada, elund eidho malu, man epodho i wie, e enege; man juyike i ot pare ma dhe i langa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo ketho Benaya ma wod Yehoiada i kakare wi udul; man ubimo ketho Zadok ma jalam i kakar Abiathar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo oro kwenda man elwong’o Cimei, ewacu ire de kumae, Gom iri ot i Yerusalem, man ibed keca, e kud iwok woko ku keca kamoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum i ceng’ m’iwok woko, man ikadhu loka kulo Kidron, dong’ ing’ei andha nia ibitho andha: rimo peri de bibedo i wii giri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Cimei wacu ni ubimo kumae, Lembawaeane e dre: calu rwoth para m’ubimo wacu, e jatic peri bitimo kumeca. E Cimei bedo i Yerusalem ceng’ dupa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre ka rundi adek uthum, nia jutic ario pa Cimei gipiei giringo ba Akic, ma wod Maka, m’ubimo mi Gath. E giyero ni Cimei, giwacu kumae, Nen, jutic peri gini i Gath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Cimei ai, man eketho jamb wo th wi kana pare, man ecidho i Gath ba Akic, kara eyeny jutic pare; e Cimei cidho, man egamu jutic pare kud i Gath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E juyero ni Suleman nia Cimei ai kud i Yerusalem ucidho i Gath, man edwogo kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ubimo oro kwenda ulwong’o Cimei ewacu ire kumae, Acimi ngo ku Yehova, man, ayero iri, awacu kumae, Dong’ ing’ei andha, nia ceng’ m’iwok woko, man iwotho bor kamoko, nia ibitho andha? e iwacu ira kumae, Lembawaca m’awinjo e dre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno iworo kwcng’ pa Yehova ngo nedi, ku lembang’ola m’ang’olo iri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubimo wacu kendo ni Cimei kumae, Ing’eyo dubo ceke m’ubedo amung’a yor i adundeni, m’itimo kum Daudi ma vwa: ka kumeno Yehova bidwoko dubo peri i wii giri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ubimo ma Suleman binwang’u mugisa, man komker pa Daudi bicungo i wang’ Yehova mi nja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ubimo ng’olo ni Benaya ma wod Yehoiada; e ecidho woko, epodho i wie, ketho etho. Man ker ucungo i cing’ Suleman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
